  fullText: "\" Student of the Sky Towers\u2026\n\nYour training has brought you
    to these sacred grounds.\n\nOnly those who learn to leap with courage, may reach
    the summit.\n\nGo now.\nClimb high.\nShow the Towers who you truly are \""
